This license covers the code, tests and documentation in this repository, and
also this repository's own provenance and selection logs that happen to live
under multiseries/data/ -- namely multiseries/data/raw/breadth_manifest.json,
multiseries/data/raw/breadth_manifest_distinct.json,
multiseries/data/raw/lineage.json and multiseries/data/fredmd/fredmd_api_codes.txt.
Those four files are produced by the code in this repository and record which
series were selected and where they came from; they contain no third-party data
values.

This license does NOT cover the third-party data caches under multiseries/data/
-- every *.parquet file there (multiseries/data/raw/*.parquet including
_state_ur_parts/, multiseries/data/fredmd/fredmd_api.parquet,
multiseries/data/state_ur.parquet, multiseries/data/unrate_vintages.parquet and
multiseries/data/open_llm.parquet). Those carry the licensing terms described in
the "Data sources and licensing" section of README.md.
